Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new@learning.com",
  "password": "helloworld15!"
}

### Get user by id
GET {{url}}/2 HTTP/1.1


### Create user
POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "firstName": "Maimouna",
  "lastName": "Sow",
  "age": 24,
  "title": "",
  "university" : "my university",
  "amount": 0,
  "appUserId" : 4
}

